When we were younger, we used to like \/ would like","x":0.55555555437400272,"y":0.20930232582795594},{"text":"dancing.","x":0.581699349151931,"w":0.06535947322845459,"h":0.01162790636734401,"y":0.22529069817291714},{"text":"Find and correct the mistakes. There is sometimes","y":0.24562864293676478,"w":0.38997821807861333,"h":0.011656952539550347,"x":0.55555555814478907},{"w":0.29411764144897468,"text":"more than one mistake in a sentence.","x":0.55555556203695045,"y":0.26144879248840414,"h":0.010407993338884203},{"x":0.55555557361375263,"y":0.27893422139334167,"text":"1 You don't get a cat unless you promise to look after it.","w":0.41830062866210938,"h":0.013322231473771873},{"x":0.55555555557258496,"w":0.010893245935440166,"h":0.010174418567717836,"y":0.30959302310470693,"text":"2"},{"y":0.30959302366773733,"w":0.37908496856689455,"h":0.013081394961037107,"text":"Pat will have cooked all day tomorrow. She's having","x":0.58169934621764197},{"h":0.013091077018439257,"y":0.32412790733416164,"w":0.12854030609130862,"text":"guests for dinner.","x":0.58169934447613225},{"text":"3 They will be finishing dinner by nine o'clock","w":0.3507625198364257,"y":0.35465116291192333,"h":0.013081394961037107,"x":0.55555556276152562},{"w":0.41394332885742191,"x":0.55555557217259599,"text":"4 Mount Vesuvius, that is active volcano, overlooks the","y":0.38509575359054093,"h":0.013322231473771873},{"text":"Bay of Naples.","x":0.58169935037635678,"w":0.11111110687255854,"y":0.39966694432395578,"h":0.011670264673669717},{"x":0.55555556539606699,"h":0.011802180224314673,"text":"5 lfI have enough money, I'd go to Australia.","y":0.43005828458726425,"w":0.34858386993408208},{"h":0.01332223187080539,"w":0.41830062866210938,"x":0.55555556199429046,"text":"6 If l had known the answer, I wouldn't ask you to help me","y":0.45920066593971698},{"y":0.48982558161347378,"h":0.013088656702605395,"w":0.2897603416442871,"text":"7 She asked me was I good at Maths.","x":0.55555556385469007},{"h":0.011842081290696971,"text":"6 Choose the correct forms.","x":0.53142940264768779,"w":0.22907875061035154,"y":0.52610159818873259},{"y":0.54496253118704663,"x":0.55991287524525746,"w":0.40522872924804687,"h":0.014630491588633832,"text":"Oldacre laughed, but he was clearly afraid of Lestrade,"},{"h":0.014058018604186429,"y":0.55929239055224378,"text":"1who \/ that was visibly upset.","w":0.2140462303161621,"x":0.557441267601121},{"y":0.5755813956050877,"x":0.5577342101916698,"h":0.01162790636734401,"w":0.38126361846923817,"text":"'I 2haven't hurt \/ hadn't hurt anybody,\/' he said. 'You"},{"h":0.01458450241152387,"text":"3 can't \/ mightn't really mean it!' Lestrade replied angrily","x":0.5577342223743128,"y":0.5886627911487381,"w":0.41176467895507807},{"y":0.6061046513948164,"x":0.55773420829786902,"text":"'Because of you McFarlane is in prison. We thought","w":0.38344226837158202,"h":0.011713833137912411},{"x":0.55773420796056139,"h":0.013081394961037107,"text":"he 4had \/ has killed you. He was in danger of being","y":0.62063953503401637,"w":0.37908496856689455},{"text":"hanged,' he added","h":0.013081394961037107,"x":0.55773420879453317,"y":0.63517441872587688,"w":0.14596949577331542},{"text":"' only did it for a joke,' said Oldacre.","w":0.27886709213256833,"x":0.55337690796421701,"y":0.64970930276937766,"h":0.014736991837856372},{"x":0.55971831447893494,"h":0.016022545610439032,"text":"'You won't 5be playing \/ have played any more jokes","y":0.66352651420092845,"w":0.38816146850585931},{"text":"from now on!' said Lestrade.","x":0.55757147668483076,"y":0.68017071402021734,"w":0.2138330841064453,"h":0.011751594988134495},{"text":"He 'told \/ said the policemen to take Oldacre away.","w":0.38344226837158213,"x":0.55991285753534181,"y":0.69608659467077949,"h":0.011762242233822717},{"w":0.41612197875976564,"h":0.013322231076738356,"text":"When they 'had gone \/ have gone, Lestrade ®said \/ told","y":0.71065778522160739,"x":0.55555556592149713},{"y":0.72674418626400239,"w":0.40522876739501956,"h":0.011807021253015693,"x":0.55773420423277342,"text":"'I must thank you, Mr Holmes. I was rude to you earlier"},{"text":"today and l am sorry. I really thought that the case was","h":0.013092287176356132,"w":0.40522872924804687,"x":0.5577342210695132,"y":0.74127907017936523},{"x":0.55773420230027182,"h":0.011821543942085344,"y":0.7556203165426898,"w":0.4139433670043946,"text":"finished. It would have been \/ be very bad indeed if Mr"},{"h":0.013322231870805279,"x":0.55773422423103658,"w":0.41830062866210938,"text":"McFarlane had been hanged for something he didn't do!","y":0.77019150677859505},{"w":0.41612197875976564,"h":0.011747719544752955,"text":"'Don't worry, Holmes told him. 'Nobody will know what","y":0.78633720960702558,"x":0.55555556315279719},{"x":0.55759776200105748,"y":0.80036855344224433,"w":0.41418060302734372,"text":"happened. It isn't necessary to say that I did anything to","h":0.014202735703950253},{"y":0.81521465186023656,"w":0.12209627151489266,"h":0.013466044925432352,"text":"help,' he added","x":0.55768824920921323},{"h":0.013086235989738237,"w":0.39651416778564452,"text":"'But don't you want people to know how clever 1ºyou","x":0.55555555722918204,"y":0.83139050791156521},{"h":0.013081394961037107,"text":"have been \/ have you been?' asked Lestrade.","w":0.33551197052001946,"x":0.5599128591118131,"y":0.84593023297006287},{"text":"'No', said Holmes. 'I am happy with my work and that is","x":0.55773421233800202,"y":0.86046511625494648,"w":0.41176467895507818,"h":0.013081394961037107},{"x":0.55773420336540414,"w":0.12418300628662104,"y":0.87635303928982922,"text":"enough for me.'","h":0.011728355826982173},{"h":0.010407993338884203,"x":0.55773419563915128,"y":0.89966694406194714,"w":0.39215686798095706,"text":"From Sir Arthur Conan Doyle, The Return of Sherlock Holmes"},{"y":0.94622093029564436,"h":0.013081394961037107,"text":"160","w":0.039215686321258561,"x":0.050108932089915389}]